{
 "_comment": "Which game model stands for each unlock, for `npm run models:export -- --cache <dir> --unlocks`. Keys are unlock names (the file is saved as public/models/<slug>.gltf, so modelFor(name) finds it). type: npc | object | item (inventory model) | worn (the item as worn, for capes). name is matched against the cache's names; '?' meant choose one from the hint; the choice is recorded in name (and id, which pins the exact def and wins over name). fallback is tried when name has no usable model; skip leaves the unlock without one. exclude drops sub-models by model id; dropGround (objects) drops faces at ground level, for a floor baked into the mesh. Grouped by unlock type for review only.",
